I think when you look at the kind of spending&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:04.880
and the kind of money printing that's happening,&nbsp;
you're getting what's called the Cantillon Effect,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:08.400
