00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:25.520
a very good point. If I were to win, God willing,&nbsp;
I'm one of 435. So I need to form coalitions. I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:30.240
need people that are on my side. I need to have a&nbsp;
maturity to understand that everybody that we're&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:33.840
in coalition with won't agree on every issue.
Speaker 1: But John, I hate to interrupt,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:38.960
but I really like I love talking about policy&nbsp;
and we were I want to stay on that instead of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:43.440
the coalition. You're talking about money&nbsp;
